  "text": "\r\n\t\t Elections & Voting | Newport, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About Newport   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Contact Info  \t\t\t \n     Find It Fast   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Absentee Ballots & Voter Information Lookup \r\n\t\t\t Acceptable Proofs of Residency for Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Buying/Selling Private Sale - This is information you need to know \r\n\t\t\t DOGS DOGS Everything DOGS \r\n\t\t\t Elections & Voting \r\n\t\t\t Supervisor of the Checklist Sessions and Elections for 2026 \r\n\t\t\t Town Clerk Forms \r\n\t\t\t Town of Newport Historical Book Digital Archive \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \nElections & Voting \r\nElections & Voting\t\t \r\nVoter Registration  (How, Where, When, What do I need...) \nAbsentee Ballot Application  (Instructions and form) \nVoter Information Look-Up and Absentee Ballot Tracking  NOTE: If looking up your voter information, make sure to scroll down below the frown face that says \"We cannot locate...\" scroll down for your voter information. It shows absentee ballots requested at the top, and if you don't have any requests...it looks like they can't find you as a voter. \nSupervisor of the Checklist Sessions and Elections \nCurrent Year Voting Opportunities: Election Schedule for Newport NH 2026 \nState Primary Election September 8, 2026 @ Newport Community Center - 17 Meadow Road Newport 8 am-7 pm.     RESULTS DEM      RESULTS REP     FULL ELECTION PACKAGE REP    FULL ELECTION PACKAGE DEM    ELECTION WORKSHEETS \nPublic Notice - Ballot Tabulator Test   \nPublic Notice - Starting Inventory for Election Day Ballots \nPublic Notice - Absentee Ballot Processing on 9/8/26 \nGeneral Election November 3, 2026 @  Newport Community Center - 17 Meadow Road Newport 8 am-7 pm.   SAMPLE BALLOT \nPublic Notice - Ballot Tabulator Test   \nPublic Notice - Starting Inventory for Election Day Ballots \nPublic Notice - Absentee Ballot Processing on  11/3/2026 \n2027 Election Schedule \nSchool District Filing Period for Elected Offices January 20-29 2027 @  SAU 43 Office \nSchool Deliberative Session To Be Determined @  Newport Middle High School Gym \nSchool Voting Session March 9, 2027 @  Newport Community Center - 17 Meadow Road Newport 8 am-7 pm. \nTown Filing Period for Elected Offices March 24- April 2, 2027 @  Town Clerk's Office \nTown Deliberative Session April 6, 2027 @  Newport Community Center - 17 Meadow Road Newport 6 pm \nTown Voting Session May 11, 2027 @  Newport Community Center - 17 Meadow Road Newport 8 am-7 pm \nElection Results For Newport: \n2014 Town Meeting \n2014 State Primary \n2014 General Election (Midterm) \n2015 Town Meeting \n2016 Presidential Primary \n2016 Town Meeting \n2016 State Primary \n2016 General Election (Presidential) \n2017 Town Meeting \n2018 Town Meeting \n2018 State Primary \n2018 General Election (Midterm)2019 Town Meeting \n2020 Presidential Primary \n2020 Town Meeting \n2020 State Primary \n2020 General Election (Presidential) \n2021 Town Meeting \n2022 Town Meeting \n2022 State Primary \n2022 General Election (Midterm) \n2023 Town Meeting \n2024 Presidential Primary Election \n2024 Town Meeting \n2024 State Primary Dem \n2024 State Primary Rep \n2024 Special Town Meeting - Voting Results \n2024 General Election (Presidential) \n2025 Town Meeting  Official Results ,  Sample Ballot (has Warrant Language) \n2026 State Primary DEM \n2026 State Primary REP   \r\n\t\t\t Public Notices \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Town Meeting \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Permits \r\n\t\t\t Assessing Database \r\nTown of Newport \r\n15 Sunapee St \r\nNewport, NH 03773 \r\nPhone:  603-863-1877 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  Civi